{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17370","headline":"晚渡扬子江却寄江南亲故 · 权德舆","name":"晚渡扬子江却寄江南亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返照满寒流，轻舟任摇漾。\n支颐见千里，烟景非一状。\n远岫有无中，片帆风水上。\n天清去鸟灭，浦迥寒沙涨。\n树晚叠秋岚，江空翻宿浪。\n胸中千万虑，对此一清旷。\n回首碧云深，佳人不可望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}